\newlabel{tab:methods}{{1}{2}{Positioning of TC-ViTok in the visual token compression landscape. Pre-LLM = decision made before LLM forward pass (saves all LLM FLOPs); inside LLM = decision made between LLM layers (saves only late-layer FLOPs)}{table.1}{}}
